5:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400","children":"Marking a creature starts a 2-second auto-attack tick — a slow, legible metronome that keeps the fight alive without demanding a tap per swing. Everything above that baseline is manual: abilities, footwork, and the shove. Two seconds is deliberately long. It is a rhythm you fight around, not a DPS engine that plays for you. Death removes 10% of experience and half of carried gold."}]
6:["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-1.5","children":[["$","li","Auto-attack fires every 2000ms on a Marked creature, melee reach only",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-amber-400","children":"▸"}],"Auto-attack fires every 2000ms on a Marked creature, melee reach only"]}],["$","li","A manual ability resets the tick — skilled play is strictly faster",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-amber-400","children":"▸"}],"A manual ability resets the tick — skilled play is strictly faster"]}],["$","li","Grid-locked movement at a 205ms base step cadence, slowed by armour",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-amber-400","children":"▸"}],"Grid-locked movement at a 205ms base step cadence, slowed by armour"]}],["$","li","Death: −10% XP, −50% carried gold, gold drops on the floor",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-amber-400","children":"▸"}],"Death: −10% XP, −50% carried gold, gold drops on the floor"]}]]}]
7:["$","article","clarity",{"className":"relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.06] to-transparent p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-yellow-500"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-3xl","children":"👁️"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-black text-slate-50","children":"Visual Readability Above All"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400/80","children":"Read the floor, not the monster"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400","children":"Danger is communicated by painting the ground. Every hostile action projects a coloured tile zone with a rising fill-bar showing time-to-impact. Player abilities telegraph identically, so PvP is symmetrical and legible. Silhouettes are chunky, outlined, and colour-coded per faction."}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-1.5","children":[["$","li","100% of incoming damage is floor-telegraphed before it lands",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-amber-400","children":"▸"}],"100% of incoming damage is floor-telegraphed before it lands"]}],["$","li","Wind-up length scales with damage: 520ms rat → 1150ms wraith",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-amber-400","children":"▸"}],"Wind-up length scales with damage: 520ms rat → 1150ms wraith"]}],["$","li","Status effects are pips above the head, never buried in a menu",{"className":"flex gap-2 text-xs text-slate-300","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-amber-400","children":"▸"}],"Status effects are pips above the head, never buried in a menu"]}],["$","li","One glance rule: a 0.4s glance must convey HP, threat and escape route",{"classNa